<v Marc Maron>So that was the big punishment?
<v Marc Maron>所以那就是大惩罚？

00:33:58.060 --> 00:34:00.140
<v Molly Shannon>Yeah, that was-- there was no punishment.
<v Molly Shannon>是的，那就是——根本没有惩罚。

00:34:00.140 --> 00:34:01.640
<v Marc Maron>No, I know. I mean, clearly--
<v Marc Maron>不，我知道。我的意思是，很显然——

00:34:01.640 --> 00:34:05.110
<v Molly Shannon>He loved that kind of stuff. Like I said, he was wild. He used to--
