00:34:05.110 --> 00:34:18.570
<v Marc Maron>I love the sort of strange nostalgic excitement you have for this borderline child abuse.
<v Marc Maron>我喜欢你对这种近乎虐待儿童的行为所表现出的那种奇怪的怀旧兴奋感。

